Hi Sergio & Larrabee, Here is the Jacobian file for AMSU-A channels 4
through 14. The NetCDF file is pretty well documented
internally. Stephen

Name: oss_bt_jac_avg.cloudy.2010.nc
Size: 191.6 MB
Expires: September 22, 2025
Download: https://mft.aer.com/download?domain=staff&id=f59f7165eb914ad0bd14beb8bdd2bf4f-0699b024d0634b79a6132e79c12dae06

%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%

s = read_netcdf_lls('oss_bt_jac_avg.cloudy.2010.nc');

% s = 
%                       lons: [72x1 single]
%                       lats: [64x1 single]
%                   lon_bnds: [73x1 single]
%                   lat_bnds: [65x1 single]
%                   channels: [11x1 int32]          
%           surface_pressure: [64x72x12 single]     4608 tiles, 12 months
%                     levels: [38x64x72x12 single]  38 levels, 4608 tiles, 12 months
%     brightness_temperature: [11x64x72x12 single]  11 chans, 4608 tiles, 12 months
%             tskin_jacobian: [11x64x72x12 single]  11 chans, 4608 tiles, 12 months
%        emissivity_jacobian: [11x64x72x12 single]  11 chans, 4608 tiles, 12 months
%       temperature_jacobian: [5-D single]          11 chans, 38 levels, 4608 tiles, 12 months
%          humidity_jacobian: [5-D single]          11 chans, 38 levels, 4608 tiles, 12 months
%                       year: 2010
%                      month: [12x1 int32]
% 

figure(1); clf
boo = squeeze(s.temperature_jacobian(:,:,32,36,6));
pcolor(s.channels,squeeze(s.levels(:,32,36,6)),boo'); colorbar; 
  colormap jet; shading interp; set(gca,'ydir','reverse'); set(gca,'yscale','log'); ylim([10 1000]);
xlabel('AMSU channel'); ylabel('P [mb]'); 
title('T jac tile latbin/lonbin 32,36')

figure(2); clf
woo = squeeze(s.humidity_jacobian(:,:,32,36,6));
pcolor(s.channels,squeeze(s.levels(:,32,36,6)),woo'); colorbar; 
  colormap jet; shading interp; set(gca,'ydir','reverse'); set(gca,'yscale','linear'); ylim([10 1000]);
xlabel('AMSU channel'); ylabel('P [mb]'); 
title('SH g/g jac tile latbin/lonbin 32,36')

figure(3); clf
soo = squeeze(s.tskin_jacobian(:,32,36,6));
plot(s.channels,soo'); colorbar; 
xlabel('AMSU channel'); ylabel('P [mb]'); 
title('SKT jac tile latbin/lonbin 32,36')

figure(4); clf
eoo = squeeze(s.emissivity_jacobian(:,32,36,6));
plot(s.channels,eoo'); colorbar; 
xlabel('AMSU channel'); ylabel('P [mb]'); 
title('emiss jac tile latbin/lonbin 32,36')
